    "description": "<p>The Afflicted creature has +4 default EVA Stages, +1 default DEF, SPDEF, and SPD Stage, and +20% RES. Each time the user is hit by a Physical- or Special-Category Attack, the Afflicted creature has a 50% chance of losing -1 EVA Stage for 3 Activations. When this effect expires, the user loses -1 DEF, SPDEF, and SPD Stage for 5 Activations and is @Affliction[delay 50].</p>",
